OL,4,BF1 bosses close to V8 engines deal     
OL,5,Bfrom 2030                              
OL,6,GFormula 1 bosses are close to a deal   
OL,7,Gthat will see V8 turbo hybrid engines  
OL,8,Greplace the current controversial      
OL,9,Gengines in 2030.                       
OL,11,FMcLaren chief executive officer Zak    
OL,12,FBrown said an "agreement in principle" 
OL,13,Fhad been reached by engine             
OL,14,Fmanufacturers and F1 bosses on the new 
OL,15,Frules.                                 
OL,17,FThese will be for a 2.1-litre V8 turbo 
OL,18,Fengine with a smaller electrical       
OL,19,Felement than this year, as first       
OL,20,Frevealed by BBC Sport last month.      
